From b.rowlingson at lancaster.ac.uk  Fri Jan 18 09:22:52 2008
From: b.rowlingson at lancaster.ac.uk (Barry Rowlingson)
Date: Fri, 18 Jan 2008 09:22:52 +0000
Subject: Re: [Rpy] multithreading with rpy
In-Reply-To: <5c5fa360801180029s1375aa2dg2032d143ccd99512@mail.gmail.com>
